      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.29,
          "en": "Now, with the configuration out of the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.29,
          "end": 9.633,
          "en": "let's make sure we can reach the detail page of such a meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 12.59,
          "en": "And for this, of course we need to add that page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.59,
          "end": 14.81,
          "en": "or that screen as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.81,
          "end": 18.31,
          "en": "And this is a great exercise for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.31,
          "end": 20.9,
          "en": "Add this brand new screen for a start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.9,
          "end": 24.787,
          "en": "It can simply contain some dummy text that says,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.787,
          "end": 27.55,
          "en": "\"this is the meal detail screen\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.55,
          "end": 30.02,
          "en": "but make sure that you add such a screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.02,
          "end": 32.67,
          "en": "that you register it as a screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.67,
          "end": 35.24,
          "en": "and that you navigate to that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.24,
          "end": 38.02,
          "en": "when such a meal item is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.02,
          "end": 41.55,
          "en": "Also make sure you pass some data to the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 45.393,
          "en": "specifically the idea of the meal that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.25,
          "end": 49.78,
          "en": "Here's a short pause I give you to pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.78,
          "end": 51.85,
          "en": "and try this on your own first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.85,
          "end": 54.633,
          "en": "Thereafter, we're going to implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.75,
          "end": 62.69,
          "en": "So, did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.69,
          "end": 64.19,
          "en": "Let's implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.67,
          "end": 69.46000000000001,
          "en": "And for this it all starts by adding a new screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.46000000000001,
          "end": 73.55,
          "en": "I'll name it Meal Detail screen because that is what it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.55,
          "end": 76.14,
          "en": "And in there we create a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 78.61,
          "en": "the meal detail screen function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.61,
          "end": 80.82300000000001,
          "en": "which of course as always is exported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.89,
          "end": 83.123,
          "en": "So that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.47,
          "end": 89.47,
          "en": "And then here, for the moment I'll just return some text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.57,
          "end": 90.83,
          "en": "but of course this Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.83,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "then must be imported from React Native as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 97.05,
          "en": "So we want to import text from React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 102.2,
          "en": "and say this is the meal detail screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.2,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "And I also wanna output the meal ID here in the future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 108.32,
          "en": "but we'll get there in a second step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.32,
          "end": 109.15299999999999,
          "en": "So for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.15299999999999,
          "end": 112.253,
          "en": "that's the dummy meal detail screen Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.3,
          "end": 116.18,
          "en": "Now to be able to go to that Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.18,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "we must register it as a screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "And we have all our screens registered in App JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 126.07,
          "en": "So there I'll add it as an additional screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.07,
          "end": 128.92,
          "en": "Now it doesn't matter where exactly you add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.92,
          "end": 131.09,
          "en": "inside this stack navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.09,
          "end": 131.923,
          "en": "The position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.923,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "doesn't matter but here I'll add it at the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 138.64,
          "en": "Add another stack screen Component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.57,
          "end": 141.97,
          "en": "and give us a name of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.97,
          "end": 143.823,
          "en": "Meal Detail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.76,
          "end": 146.253,
          "en": "Name is up to you, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.45,
          "end": 150.16,
          "en": "Now we need to define which Component should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.16,
          "end": 152,
          "en": "if we navigate to this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "And that would be the meal detail screen Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 159.9,
          "en": "And of course this Component must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.9,
          "end": 162.69299999999998,
          "en": "in order to be available in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.49,
          "end": 167.25,
          "en": "So with that, the screen is registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.25,
          "end": 170.53,
          "en": "and we can also already give this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.53,
          "end": 172.12,
          "en": "a title if you want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.12,
          "end": 174.77,
          "en": "but I'll come back to this in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.77,
          "end": 177.43,
          "en": "For the moment let's make sure we can get to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.43,
          "end": 182.02,
          "en": "And I wanna be able to get to by tapping on a meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.02,
          "end": 183.74,
          "en": "Now we got this meal item Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.74,
          "end": 186.23,
          "en": "with the pressable Component in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.23,
          "end": 190.313,
          "en": "but ultimately I want to start this navigation action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 193.44,
          "en": "And we could start the navigation action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.44,
          "end": 195.95,
          "en": "from inside meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.95,
          "end": 200.9,
          "en": "Now we could also start it from inside meal overview screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.9,
          "end": 204.07999999999998,
          "en": "And it's up to you where you want to take care about this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.07999999999998,
          "end": 206.42000000000002,
          "en": "I will do it from inside meal item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.42000000000002,
          "end": 209.37,
          "en": "just so that we also see this alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 211.85,
          "en": "because before with the category,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.85,
          "end": 215.94,
          "en": "we did not start the navigation from inside the grid tile.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.94,
          "end": 219,
          "en": "Instead there we used categories screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219,
          "end": 222.41,
          "en": "Now to you the usage of the use navigation Hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.41,
          "end": 224.98,
          "en": "I will do it from inside meal item JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.98,
          "end": 228.4,
          "en": "because this Component is not a screen Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.4,
          "end": 233.4,
          "en": "and therefore it does not get the navigation or route props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.28,
          "end": 237.14,
          "en": "But we need access to these props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.14,
          "end": 239.17000000000002,
          "en": "or at least to the navigation prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.17000000000002,
          "end": 242.74,
          "en": "And you learned already, that you can get hold of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.74,
          "end": 244.66,
          "en": "by using a special hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.66,
          "end": 248.85,
          "en": "provided from @reactnavigation/native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.85,
          "end": 251.69,
          "en": "And that would be the use navigation hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.69,
          "end": 254.97,
          "en": "This hook can be executed in any Component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 256.67,
          "en": "including meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.67,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "And if we execute it, we get a navigation object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "which has the same shape as the object we get through props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 266.8,
          "en": "through the navigation prop in a screen Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 266.8,
          "end": 270.99,
          "en": "And on navigation we therefore can call navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.99,
          "end": 274.51,
          "en": "And then we, first of all, need the identifier of the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.51,
          "end": 276.51,
          "en": "to which we wanna navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.51,
          "end": 281.51,
          "en": "And in this case, that would be the meal detail here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.69,
          "end": 284.90999999999997,
          "en": "So that's this identifier I wanna use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.90999999999997,
          "end": 289.11,
          "en": "So let's grab this and go back to meal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.11,
          "end": 291.323,
          "en": "and use this identifier here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.3,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "Now I mentioned before that I also wanna pass in some data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.08,
          "end": 298.99,
          "en": "I wanna pass some params to this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 298.99,
          "end": 302.32,
          "en": "To be precise I wanna pass the ID off the meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 302.32,
          "end": 304.35,
          "en": "that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.35,
          "end": 308.37,
          "en": "We can achieve this by passing this second parameter value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 308.37,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "which is our params object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 313.88,
          "en": "And in there, we can set up any key value params we want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.88,
          "end": 318.213,
          "en": "for example add a meal ID param and set it to a value of ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 319.98,
          "end": 324.79,
          "en": "expecting ID to be a prop which we receive in meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.79,
          "end": 328.54,
          "en": "So now I'm using this ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 328.54,
          "end": 329.64,
          "en": "That's what I'm doing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.72,
          "end": 333.23,
          "en": "But of course, for this to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 333.23,
          "end": 338.23,
          "en": "we must make sure that such a ID prop is set on meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.42,
          "end": 341.05,
          "en": "So in the meal overview screen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 341.05,
          "end": 345.56,
          "en": "where we render all the meal items, we have to add ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.56,
          "end": 348.653,
          "en": "to these props that are added to meal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 349.67,
          "end": 351.76,
          "en": "And thankfully our meal item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 351.76,
          "end": 356.06,
          "en": "which we have here, does have such a ID property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 356.06,
          "end": 358.57,
          "en": "So we can access item.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 358.57,
          "end": 362.313,
          "en": "and set the ID prop with help of this line of code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.69,
          "end": 367.94,
          "en": "So now we should be able to navigate to meal detail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 367.94,
          "end": 370.69,
          "en": "Now from inside this meal item Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 370.69,
          "end": 373.8,
          "en": "with help of the use navigation hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 373.8,
          "end": 378.443,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this and force a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 380.49,
          "end": 383.343,
          "en": "I can tap this item and nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 384.25,
          "end": 387.35,
          "en": "Instead, I go to this detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 387.35,
          "end": 389.79,
          "en": "whenever I select a category.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 389.79,
          "end": 391.103,
          "en": "But why is this happening?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 392.03,
          "end": 395.72,
          "en": "This happens because at the moment I of course call navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 395.72,
          "end": 398.92,
          "en": "from directly inside the meal item Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 398.92,
          "end": 402.273,
          "en": "We wanna do that when this meal item is pressed instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 403.28,
          "end": 406.05,
          "en": "So what we should do is add a function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 406.05,
          "end": 410.023,
          "en": "the select meal item handler, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 410.89,
          "end": 414.223,
          "en": "And trigger this navigate method from inside this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 415.27,
          "end": 418.09000000000003,
          "en": "And then this select meal item handler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 418.09000000000003,
          "end": 420.44,
          "en": "should be connected to pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 420.44,
          "end": 425.44,
          "en": "So to our button with help of that on press prop, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 425.69,
          "end": 427.27,
          "en": "Now that's the proper setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 427.27,
          "end": 430.36,
          "en": "And if we now save this and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 430.36,
          "end": 434.863,
          "en": "we can go here, select the detail and go to the detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 435.92,
          "end": 438.64,
          "en": "But of course at the moment, we're not extracting that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 438.64,
          "end": 441.13,
          "en": "meal ID that we're setting as a param",
